m/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506566134,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VZyn2","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T17:36:43Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T17:37:05Z","body":"> Remember to change the list of available CLI arguments in `main/main.cpp`, as some of them won't work anymore. (The arguments could still be parsed but print an error when used, but they shouldn't be listed in `--help`.)\r\n\r\nRight, I'm not super sure about the status of CLI arguments.\r\nE.g. the `--profiling` option seems to enable the scripts profiler in the debugger, the `--gpu-profile` seems to be doing nothing at all (should it enable the \"visual profiler\" instead?).\r\n\r\nThe `gpu-validation` option which mentions debugging seems to just store values in the rendering engine, what should we do with it?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506566134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506588191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99803#issuecomment-2506588191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506588191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VZ4Af","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T17:50:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T17:50:51Z","body":"> E.g. the `--profiling` option seems to enable the scripts profiler in the debugger, the `--gpu-profile` seems to be doing nothing at all (should it enable the \"visual profiler\" instead?).\r\n>\r\n> The `gpu-validation` option which mentions debugging seems to just store values in the rendering engine, what should we do with it?\r\n\r\ncc @DarioSamo @darksylinc \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506588191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506612745","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99803#issuecomment-2506612745","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506612745,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VZ-AJ","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T18:13:16Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T18:15:18Z","body":"I have multiple questions to better understand this PR:\r\n\r\n1. Why is the debugger being disabled? I can guess, why, but I'd prefer to hear it from the one having this need. How was it before, and how it is after and why is that better?\r\n2. Does this affect Android & iOS? Where debugging is the main way of interfacing with the deployed apk (which is usually a template_release). Maybe I'm wrong and this type of debugger does not affect Android / iOS.\r\n3. It sounds like this feature may want to interact with the \"production\" SCons option (ok this is not a question :yum: ), although the Editor for Android wants to build with the production flag set, for some odd reason.\r\n\r\n> The gpu-validation option which mentions debugging seems to just store values in the rendering engine, what should we do with it?\r\n\r\nNo, that's wrong.\r\n\r\n`--gpu-validation` sets `Engine::use_validation_layers`, which is read by `RenderingContextDriverD3D12::use_validation_layers` and `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_use_validation_layers` and they both follow branches of code when set, e.g. see `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_initialize_instance` and `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_initialize_vulkan_version`.\r\n\r\nHowever I don't see `--gpu-validation` CLI option being affected by this change? Am I missing something? (I only took a quick glance).\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\n**Edit:** Regarding `--gpu-profile`, it seems the option does not exist at all. I can't see any references to it other than the help description.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506612745/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506632679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99803#issuecomment-2506632679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506632679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VaC3n","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T18:34:30Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T18:34:30Z","body":"> 1. Why is the debugger being disabled? I can guess, why, but I'd prefer to hear it from the one having this need. How was it before, and how it is after and why is that better?\r\n\r\nPeople kept complaining that you could interact with the game in release mode by attaching the debugger to the editor (e.g. adding break points, stepping, etc).  This was possible before, and only some features were disabled (e.g. live scene editing).\r\n\r\n> 2\\. Does this affect Android & iOS? Where debugging is the main way of interfacing with the deployed apk (which is usually a template_release). Maybe I'm wrong and this type of debugger does not affect Android / iOS.\r\n\r\nIt affects all platforms, but the editor uses `template_debug` when deploying on device for debugging purposes. `template_release` are for distribution, and I'm not anyone uses `template_release` (released) APKs with the engine debugger (I'm not even sure the exporter can set the remote debug flag when exporting in release mode).\r\n\r\n> `--gpu-validation` sets `Engine::use_validation_layers`, which is read by `RenderingContextDriverD3D12::use_validation_layers` and `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_use_validation_layers` and they both follow branches of code when set, e.g. see `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_initialize_instance` and `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_initialize_vulkan_version`.\r\n\r\nRight, so indeed this has nothing to do with the engine debugger, and should probably left alone.\r\n\r\n> However I don't see `--gpu-validation` CLI option being affected by this change? Am I missing something? (I only took a quick glance).\r\n\r\nI was asked to disable debugging CLI options, and I'm not very familiar with those. Which is why I was asking about this specific option that mentioned \"debugging\".\r\n\r\n> Regarding `--gpu-profile`, it seems the option does not exist at all. I can't see any references to it other than the help description.\r\n\r\nYes, that was my conclusion, and was asking if anyone knew what it was supposed to do.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506632679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506661281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99803#issuecomment-2506661281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506661281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VaJ2h","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T19:05:32Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T19:05:32Z","body":"@Calinou it seems that `--gpu-profile` used to be `--profile-gpu` before #55703 but only the printed argument was updated, and the parsed argument was left as [`--profile-gpu`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f4a05733792/main/main.cpp#L1734) (and it's still present like that).\r\n\r\nThat also seems to be setting something to the rendering server (`set_print_gpu_profile`) so I guess it should not be touched by this PR.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506661281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506663832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99803#issuecomment-2506663832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506663832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VaKeY","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T19:08:23Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T19:08:23Z","body":"I also think instead of `--profiling` we should have something like `--enable-debugger-profilers <LIST>` or multiple `--enable-debugger-profiler <NAME>` to enable specific profilers at startup instead of one option for every profiler (again, probably material for a new PR).","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506663832/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506774042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99803#issuecomment-2506774042","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99803","id":2506774042,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ValYa","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T21:32:30Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T21:32:30Z","body":"@Calinou I've removed the options that seemed relevant:\r\n```\r\n--debug\r\n--profiling\r\n--remote-debug\r\n--skip-breakpoints (which is not printed in the help)\r\n--br